kind: skit
id: all-rise
title: All Rise, Lightly Browned
about: Cue conducts a courtroom rehearsal in the junk drawer while Tabby pops up and Gruff argues the recipe

[scene 1]
cue: "Court is in session. All rise." ; do nod ; take cast ; move left 2 ; cam wide
gruff: "I am standing." ; do shrug ; take toaster-shrug ; move wide-left 2 ; cam low-angle
tabby: "So am I." ; do nod ; jump 1.5 ; move right 2 ; cam two-shot
cue: "Then who just went up?" ; do gasp ; react tilt ; cam reaction

# Hold through the scene change. Cue follows the toast with his eyes.
[scene 2]
tabby: "One slice. Very straight back." ; do tilt ; take walk-right ; move center 2 ; cam closeup
cue: "Will the witness please take the stand?" ; do nod ; take acting-sheet ; cam two-shot
gruff: "It's on the stand. You're reading the recipe." ; do laugh ; move center 2 ; cam reaction
cue: "I see. Both sides may now be heard." ; do nod ; take letter ; move left 2 ; cam wide

# The turn belongs to Tabby. Gruff waits for the second side.
[scene 3]
tabby: "This side says crunch." ; do cheer ; take toast ; jump 1.5 ; cam closeup
gruff: "Turn it over." ; do shrug ; move left 2 ; cam reaction
tabby: "Crunch." ; do laugh ; celebrate 2 ; cam closeup
cue: "First time both sides have agreed." ; do bow ; celebrate 3 ; move center 2 ; cam wide
